[1644.735099,"o","\u001b[0m\u001b[H\u001b[2J\r\n  Enable bounded byte accounting\r\n  ==============================\r\n\r\n  Enable eBPF traffic accounting with source-IP attribution.\r\n  The export interval is 250 ms, map capacity is 256 entries, and the\r\n  stale-entry timeout is 60000 ms.\r\n\r\n  These are cumulative byte totals, not packet payloads or live rates.\r\n  The bounded maps limit accounting state while the router runs.\r\n"]
