[1977.006159,"o","\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[1977.044078,"o","\u001b[H\u001b[2J\r\n  Configure, observe, diagnose, recover\r\n  =====================================\r\n\r\n  RPKI and IRR checked routes. BFD and OSPF tracked reachability.\r\n  IPsec carried protected traffic. VRRP tracked the uplink and failed over.\r\n  Traffic accounting identified a source. Commit confirmed restored safety.\r\n\r\n  One router stayed running through every live commit and repair.\r\n  Each chapter is also available as a standalone topic recording.\r\n"]
